{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "The Storm Tyrant",
  "description": "A boss where you read the telegraph. Fight 3 Storm Avatars (4 rounds each; a kill shatters one of 3 Storm Crowns). After each, the party votes where to shelter from a Cataclysm. The right answer is hinted in the narration: first obvious, then subtle, then cryptic. A wrong pick or tie does heavy damage, applies Static (+25% damage taken) and adds 1 Wrath. The final Tyrant fight starts with a 150 shield per surviving Crown, gains Tempest stacks equal to Wrath, and Thunderclaps every round. Plant a Lightning Rod halves incoming damage. Rewrite the riddles freely. Next: storm broken. Failure: final fight times out.",
  "entry": "tyrant_peak",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "tyrant_peak",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Storm Tyrant's Peak",
      "text": "At the summit, a giant crowned with **three Storm Crowns** holds the sky in his fist.\n\nHe fights through **Storm Avatars**. Between avatars he calls down a **Cataclysm**, and the only warning is *how he summons it*. **Read the narration** and vote for where to shelter.\n\nEvery shattered Crown weakens his final form. Every wrong shelter feeds his **Wrath**.",
      "next": "tyrant_1",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tyrant_1",
      "kind": "battle",
      "title": "Storm Avatar 1 of 3",
      "text": "The first avatar coalesces from a thunderhead.\n\nDestroy the avatar within **4 rounds** to shatter one of the Tyrant's **Storm Crowns**.",
