      "kind": "choice",
      "title": "Cataclysm I: Lightning",
      "text": "The Tyrant points his spear at the **eastern spire**. Lightning crawls up its stone, crackling brighter every second. Behind you, the ravine howls with wind strong enough to lift a horse.\n\n**Where do you shelter?**",
